+### `computer_list_apps`
+
+列出视觉应用策略允许且能够在前台运行的 macOS 应用。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {}
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_list_windows`
+
+列出屏幕上的精确 macOS 窗口及其 id、标题、应用与边界。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {}
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_move`
+
+把 macOS 指针移动到语义元素令牌或绝对屏幕坐标，而不执行点击。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "element": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Snapshot-scoped element token."
+    },
+    "x": {
+      "type": "number",
+      "description": "Screenshot pixel x when element is omitted."
+    },
+    "y": {
+      "type": "number",
+      "description": "Screenshot pixel y when element is omitted."
+    },
+    "observation_id": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Required with x/y. One-action token returned by the immediately preceding computer_screenshot."
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_open_app`
+
+按已安装应用的精确显示名称，启动唯一解析的 macOS 应用或将其置于前台。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "name": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Exact installed application display name; ambiguous matches fail closed."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "name"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_screenshot`
+
+仅捕获已获授权的最前台窗口，并将它置于其余区域全黑的主显示器坐标画布上，然后返回一次性操作观察令牌。如果最前台目标被排除或无法读取，则失败关闭。将 observationId 作为 observation_id 传给下一次依赖焦点的坐标、输入、按键或滚动操作。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {}
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_screenshot_window`
+
+捕获一个策略允许的精确窗口。对于敏感的截图排除应用，该操作会拒绝执行。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "window_id": {
+      "type": "integer",
+      "description": "CoreGraphics window id from computer_list_windows."
+    },
+    "app": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Application name when window_id is omitted."
+    },
+    "title": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Exact window title when selecting by app."
+    }
+  }
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_scroll`
+
+滚动前台应用；可以先聚焦一个新鲜的语义元素令牌。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "direction": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "enum": [
+        "up",
+        "down",
+        "left",
+        "right"
+      ]
+    },
+    "amount": {
+      "type": "integer",
+      "description": "Bounded scroll step count; defaults to 5."
+    },
+    "element": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Optional token to focus before scrolling."
+    },
+    "observation_id": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Required when element is omitted. One-action token from the immediately preceding computer_screenshot."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "direction"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_type`
+
+向当前聚焦的 macOS 元素输入字面文本；可以先聚焦一个新鲜的语义元素令牌。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "text": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Text to type."
+    },
+    "element": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Optional token from computer_get_window_state to focus before typing."
+    },
+    "observation_id": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "Required when element is omitted. One-action token from the immediately preceding computer_screenshot."
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "text"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+### `computer_use_task`
+
+自主操作 macOS 桌面以完成任务：反复截取屏幕、询问已配置的 GUI 模型下一步应在哪里点击、输入或按键，然后执行该动作，直到模型报告任务完成或步骤预算耗尽。开放式桌面任务应使用此工具；对于一个具体且已知的操作，请优先使用基础 computer_* 工具。
+
+```json
+{
+  "type": "object",
+  "properties": {
+    "task": {
+      "type": "string",
+      "description": "The task to accomplish on the desktop, in natural language."
+    },
+    "max_steps": {
+      "type": "integer",
+      "description": "Step budget from 1 to 100 before giving up. Defaults to 20 unless changed visually."
+    },
+    "postcondition": {
+      "type": "object",
+      "description": "Optional host-verified completion criteria. An empty object is rejected.",
+      "additionalProperties": false,
+      "properties": {
+        "frontmost_app": {
+          "type": "string",
+          "description": "Expected frontmost application name (case/punctuation-insensitive)."
+        },
+        "frontmost_pid": {
+          "type": "integer",
+          "description": "Expected frontmost process id."
+        },
+        "window": {
+          "type": "object",
+          "description": "A visible window that must match every supplied field.",
+          "additionalProperties": false,
+          "properties": {
+            "id": {
+              "type": "integer"
+            },
+            "app": {
+              "type": "string"
+            },
+            "title": {
+              "type": "string"
+            },
+            "title_contains": {
+              "type": "string"
+            }
+          }
+        }
+      }
+    }
+  },
+  "required": [
+    "task"
+  ]
+}
+```
+
+来源：[`packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts`](../packages/macos-use/tool-macos-use/src/index.ts)
+
+基础桌面与浏览器工具直接通过其能力 seam 执行。computer_use_task 和 browser_use_task 每个步骤都会调用一次单独配置的 GUI 视觉模型。启用的步骤截图是持久工具结果元数据，仅由客户端渲染；驱动模型接收文本任务结果。
+
